{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09028","headline":"秋集罢还途中作谨献寿春公黎公 · 韦应物","name":"秋集罢还途中作谨献寿春公黎公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"束带自衡门，奉命宰王畿。\n君侯枉高鉴，举善掩瑕疵。\n斯民本已安，工拙两无施。\n何以酬明德，岁晏不磷缁。\n时节乃来集，欣怀方载驰。\n平明大府开，一得拜光辉。\n温如春风至，肃若严霜威。\n羣属所载瞻，而忘倦与饥。\n公堂燕华筵，礼罢复言辞。\n将从平门道，憩车沣水湄。\n山川降嘉岁，草木蒙润滋。\n孰云还本邑，怀恋独迟迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09028.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09028","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}